# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# The app uses createBrowserRouter, so every route is client-side. Cloudflare
# serves static files by default, which means a refresh or a shared link to
# /admin/trains looks for a file that does not exist and returns 404 — while
# the root works, which is why the bug reads as "random".
#
# This rewrite hands any path that is not a real file to index.html and lets
# React Router resolve it. Vite copies public/ into dist/ unchanged, so no
# vite.config.js change is needed.
/*    /index.html   200